  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA encoder choice (scvi_n200 vs pca_n2000) and aggregation methods (avgpool vs transformer) influence performance, but their impact in multimodal multiprofile settings remains unclear. This experiment tests pca_n2000 RNA encoder with avgpool aggregation in a multimodal multiprofile setup, directly comparing it to config_030 (scvi_n200 with avgpool). It isolates the RNA encoder's effect while maintaining consistent fusion (concat) and image encoder (resnet50), addressing key uncertainty about encoder importance in multiprofile multimodal models."  
}

